      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sea-envy/{size}/1849_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-09-30T06:20:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>“The Multiverse According to Paul” was an excellent bit and well worth everyone’s time, thank you Christopher for making that happen. :3</p>\n<p>I’m so glad we know how to spell Hud Bwyta now. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Wish I could remember what the heck it is. Nightmist monster?</p>\n<p>Oh dear, the Andy questions are becoming a Thing now…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The Hud Bwyta was a magic eating worm. it disenchanted magic items and removed spells<br>\nIt grew from finger size to bus size</p>",
